# Unreleased
- [add][minor] Dynamically adjust poll timeout based on packets going from worker to controller.
- [change][minor] Increase default maximum poll timeout to 50 milliseconds.
- [change][minor] Increase default read and write timeouts to 200 milliseconds.

# Version 0.2.2 - 2026-06-10
- [add][minor] Add `--version` command line flag to show the application version.
- [add][minor] Add a short description of the application in the CLI help.

# Version 0.2.1 - 2026-06-09
- [fix][minor] Fix the size of the payload buffer.

# Version 0.2.0 - 2026-06-08
- [change][major] Use COBS encoding for the packet list.
- [change][major] Encode packet sizes as `u16` instead of `u32`.
- [add][minor] Linux: Allow creating the tunnel interfaces in a named netns.
- [add][minor] Make the maximum payload size over the serial line configurable.
- [fix][minor] Refuse to allocate buffer space for excessively large payloads.
- [fix][minor] Check if CLI provided prefix lengths are valid for their address family.
- [fix][minor] Fix the default poll timeout for the `local` CLI command.
- [add][minor] Improve the README.

# Version 0.1.0 - 2026-06-04
- [add][minor] Initial release
